# FinFlow Loan Management System - Architecture Diagrams

This document contains the high-level design (HLD), low-level design (LLD), flow diagrams, and architectural components of the FinFlow Loan Management System. The diagrams are generated using Mermaid, which allows them to be rendered visually. 

You can view these diagrams right here, and easily right-click to copy or save them as images (PNG) directly from your browser or chat interface.

## 1. High Level Design (HLD) / System Architecture

The HLD illustrates the overall microservices architecture of the system. It shows the React frontend, the API Gateway, all backend microservices, the shared infrastructure (Eureka, Config Server, RabbitMQ, Zipkin), and external integrations like the Dropbox API.

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Client
        React[React Frontend App]
    end

    subgraph Infrastructure
        Eureka[Eureka Server<br/>Service Discovery]
        Zipkin[Zipkin<br/>Distributed Tracing]
        RabbitMQ[RabbitMQ<br/>Event Broker]
        MySQL[(MySQL Database<br/>Per-Service Schema)]
    end

    subgraph API Gateway Layer
        Gateway[API Gateway<br/>Port: 8080]
    end

    subgraph Microservices
        Auth[Auth Service<br/>Port: 8081]
        App[Application Service<br/>Port: 8082]
        Doc[Document Service<br/>Port: 8083]
        Admin[Admin Service<br/>Port: 8084]
    end
    
    subgraph External Systems
        Dropbox[Dropbox API<br/>Cloud Storage]
    end

    React -->|REST Calls| Gateway
    
    Gateway -->|Routes| Auth
    Gateway -->|Routes| App
    Gateway -->|Routes| Doc
    Gateway -->|Routes| Admin
    
    Auth -->|Read/Write| MySQL
    App -->|Read/Write| MySQL
    Doc -->|Read/Write| MySQL
    Admin -->|Read/Write| MySQL
    
    Doc -->|Upload/Download| Dropbox
    
    App -.->|Pub/Sub Events| RabbitMQ
    Doc -.->|Pub/Sub Events| RabbitMQ
    
    Gateway -.->|Registers| Eureka
    Auth -.->|Registers| Eureka
    App -.->|Registers| Eureka
    Doc -.->|Registers| Eureka
    Admin -.->|Registers| Eureka
    
    Gateway -.->|Traces| Zipkin
    Auth -.->|Traces| Zipkin
    App -.->|Traces| Zipkin
    Doc -.->|Traces| Zipkin
    Admin -.->|Traces| Zipkin
```

